---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-300 mt-24 border-t border-slate-800/80 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle background glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-600/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-16 pb-12 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-10">
      
      <!-- Brand & Mission (2 cols on md) -->
      <div class="space-y-4 md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base shadow-sm">
            ⚡
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="text-white font-extrabold text-lg tracking-tight">机场推荐指南</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">jichangtuijian.site</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed pr-6">
          聚焦中文网络科学上网资讯与真实评测。收录并持续核验全网 27 家主流机场节点服务，提供 IPLC 专线分析、性价比测算、流媒体与 AI 工具解锁验证、全平台客户端配置教程。
        </p>
        
        <!-- Live status telemetry capsule -->
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-xs space-y-2 max-w-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px]">
            <span class="text-slate-400">持续网络链路遥测</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-400 font-mono">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              ALL SYSTEMS ONLINE
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
            <span>收录服务商: 27 家</span>
            <span>IndexNow: 实时推送</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section Navigation -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-200 tracking-wider uppercase mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1 h-3 rounded bg-blue-500"></span>
          专题导航
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/recommend/" class="hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">🔥 机场精选推荐</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/budget/" class="hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">💰 高性价比便宜机场</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/premium/" class="hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">🚀 高端 IPLC 专线</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/ai/" class="hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">🤖 ChatGPT / Claude 节点</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/streaming/" class="hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">🎬 4K 流媒体解锁专区</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ranking/overall/" class="hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">🏆 2026 综合实力排行榜</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Guides & Tooling -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-200 tracking-wider uppercase mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1 h-3 rounded bg-cyan-500"></span>
          客户端与工具
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/compare/" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">⚖️ 在线横向参数对比</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/windows/" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">💻 Windows 客户端指南</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/android/" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">📱 Android 客户端指南</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/ios/" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">🍎 iOS 小火箭 / Loon 指南</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/macos/" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">🖥️ macOS Clash / Surge 指南</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">📚 30 篇保姆级教程总汇</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Trust & Legal -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-200 tracking-wider uppercase mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1 h-3 rounded bg-indigo-500"></span>
          编辑与声明
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/about/" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">关于本站</a></li>
          <li><a href="/editorial-policy/" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">独立编辑政策与评测准则</a></li>
          <li><a href="/disclaimer/" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">免责声明与合规提醒</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy-policy/" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">隐私安全政策</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact/" class="hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">联系方式与反馈建议</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 font-mono">XML 网站地图 (Sitemap)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Transparency & Copyright -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-slate-900 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed space-y-3">
      <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">
        <strong class="text-slate-300">透明度披露：</strong>本站部分机场链接包含邀请代码（Affiliate Links）。如您通过本站链接注册，我们可能获得少量推广收益以维持全天候节点监控与测速服务器开支。本站承诺所有评分与排名均基于真实参数与公开测试，绝不因商业合作修改事实数据。强烈建议读者秉持「月付优先」原则。
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between text-slate-400 text-[11px] pt-3 border-t border-slate-900 font-mono">
        <p>© {currentYear} jichangtuijian.site · 中文机场节点与梯子推荐资讯平台</p>
        <p class="mt-2 sm:mt-0 text-slate-400">Static Generated by Astro · Edge Deployed</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
